---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { levels } from '../../lib/curriculum';
---
<Base title="Japanese Learning Pathway — N5 to N1" description="Explore the five-level Japanese course pathway at FreeJapaneseAcademy, from beginner N5 to advanced N1." breadcrumbs={[{label:'Courses',href:'/learn/'}]}>
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>›</span><span>Courses</span></nav><span class="eyebrow">EXPLORE YOUR PATH</span><h1>Every level starts<br/>with curiosity.</h1><p>Five clearly connected stages, from your first Japanese characters to advanced understanding. Browse the roadmap below and start with our live N5 lesson preview.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE JLPT PATHWAY</span><h2>Find your starting point.</h2></div><p class="lead">New to Japanese? N5 is the natural first step. Already studying? Explore how the later levels will be organized.</p></div>
    <div class="foundation-feature"><span class="eyebrow">NEW TO JAPANESE?</span><div><h2>Start at Level 0.</h2><p>Before JLPT N5, learn how Japanese writing works. Our first Foundations lesson is available as an early-access draft.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/">Explore Japanese Foundations ↗</a></div>
    <div class="course-grid">{levels.map(level => <a href={`/learn/${level.id}/`} class={`course-card tone-${level.tone}`}><span class="course-num">{level.rank}</span><div class="course-symbol" aria-hidden="true">{level.label}</div><strong>{level.name}</strong><small>{level.stage}</small><div class="course-bottom"><span>View pathway</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></a>)}</div>
    <div class="course-notice"><strong>Currently a preview:</strong> The complete Japanese curriculum and authentic full-length practice exams have not been published yet. A short N5 lesson and quiz are available to demonstrate the learning experience.</div>
  </div></section>
</Base>
